  "name": "Double or Nothing",
  "description": "Push-your-luck gambling den. The party votes to roll or cash out across four escalating tables (60% / 50% / 40% / 25%). Wins pay Lucky Chips, spendable in any later battle with the Lucky Chip action for a 50-damage strike. A loss takes every chip and Jinxes the party. The last table bets the party's souls: a jackpot on win, the Failure port on a loss. Next: cashed out, bust or jackpot. Failure: lost the soul wager.",
