      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Grinning Croupier",
      "text": "A velvet tent that was not here a moment ago. Inside, a croupier with too many teeth shuffles a deck made of old contracts.\n\n\"Welcome, welcome! Every wager you win pays out in **Lucky Chips**. Flick one at your enemies in battle and watch what luck can do. Walk away whenever you like... but lose a roll, and the House keeps *everything*.\"",
      "next": "table_1",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
      "id": "table_1",
      "kind": "choice",
      "title": "Table 1: The Bones",
      "text": "Two knucklebone dice, carved with little screaming faces.\n\n**Odds:** 60% • **Win:** +1 Lucky Chip • **Lose:** the House takes every chip and leaves you Jinxed.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "roll",
          "label": "Roll! (60% to win)",
          "next": "roll_1"
